#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid ""
"An LCARS-inspired WordPress theme for n0kmo.com, styled after the LCARS "
"website templates at TheLCARS.com. It has elbow-framed header and content "
"panels, segmented colour bars, an animated data cascade, LCARS button "
"navigation, a side-panel menu, a live UTC clock with stardates, and four "
"colour schemes (Classic, Nemesis Blue, Lower Decks and Red Alert). It also "
"includes LCARS block styles and patterns for the block editor, and works "
"with Elementor and the Elementor Pro Theme Builder. Star Trek and LCARS are "
"trademarks of CBS Studios Inc.; this is an unofficial fan work and is not "
"affiliated with or endorsed by them."
msgstr ""

